	//
	// THE FIRST OF TWO CALLS THAT MAKE AN ONPLO ACCOUNT (Account → Sign up). Send the username and
	// the facts Account records about the person; Onplo mints a sign-up and answers
	// `creation_options`: hand it to the browser's passkey API untouched, and the device makes the
	// person's first passkey, or a security key does.
