// WHAT THE TOKEN IS. It says which device record is calling, in which account environment,
// and nothing else. It lives at most an hour. It ends AT ONCE when the device's certificate
// ends — a retired or un-enrolled device is refused on its next call, not when the hour is
// up. It signs no person in and carries no permission: what a device may call is marked in
// each contract as an operation a device makes about itself.
