// proved the device by then. `certificate_request_unreadable`: no PKCS #10 request can be
// read from it. `certificate_request_not_signed_by_its_key`: its signature was not made by
// the key inside it. `key_not_certified`: the key is not a P-256 one. `key_ended`: a
// certificate for that key was ended, and such a key is never certified again.
