// EndSession Sign out of every app this browser is signed in to
//
// THE END-SESSION ENDPOINT (OpenID Connect RP-Initiated Logout 1.0; architecture decision record
// 037 rule Five). An app sends the browser here to sign its person out of single sign-on. The
