// SwitchEnvironmentWithBody Open a session in another environment you are a member of, or administer through its parent
//
// HOW A SIGNED-IN PERSON STEPS INTO ANOTHER COMPANY. A session acts in one environment, so a
// switch opens a NEW session in the one named, and answers its token once. The session that
// asked is not changed and not ended: switching back uses it while it lasts.
//
