// GrantAuthorizationCodeWithBody Keep the sign-in for this browser, on the way back to the app
//
// THE THIRD CALL, FOR AN APP SIGNING IN THROUGH SINGLE SIGN-ON (architecture decision record
// 037). It takes the place `openSignedInSession` has when the sign-in screen signs itself in:
// where that opens a session and hands its token to the screen, this keeps the sign-in for the
// browser (rule Five) and answers the address to send the browser to: identity's own
