	// where that opens a session and hands its token to the screen, this keeps the sign-in for the
	// browser (rule Five) and answers the address to send the browser to: identity's own
	// `keepSignInForBrowser`, carrying a one-time handoff and the app's request, which keeps the
	// cookie and sends the browser on to the app with its one code.
