// KeepSignInForBrowserWithResponse Keep the sign-in for this browser, and send it on to the app with its code
//
// THE SIGN-IN KEPT FOR THE BROWSER (architecture decision record 037 rule Five). After the
// passkey, `grantAuthorizationCode` sends the browser here, to identity's own address, with a
