// signature, another site, no user verification, a passkey that is not this person's: saying
// which would teach somebody what to fix. Start a new ceremony.
//
// Not gated: proving it is you is not something a company grants or withholds.
//
// Takes any type of body and a specified content type, and returns a wrapper object for the known response body format(s).
//
// Corresponds with POST /passkey-proofs/{passkey_proof_id}/completion (the `CompletePasskeyProof` operationId).
